{
    "pageid": 2667,
    "title": "Government modding",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Governments were introduced in patch 2.4 and are associated to characters."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "They allow to dissociate the type of the capital holding from the actual government, which was problematic before patch 2.4."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "For performance reasons governments are only validated when a title is gained/removed, liege relationship changes and religion changes. [1]"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": ""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Government group",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Government groups are hardcoded. There are 5 groups:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "feudal_governments, for which is_feudal = yes",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "republic_governments, for which is_republic = yes",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "theocracy_governments, for which is_theocracy = yes",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "tribal_governments, for which is_tribal = yes",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "nomadic_governments, for which is_nomadic = yes",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
